From 7868c20674692392fee68b5ed759c2307d35930d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PeterChamp <peter@maszatai.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 04:20:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] Fix dart2js sentinel fold and bundle local font for
 trend arrows

- dart2js constant-folds 1<<60 to 0, so hourly window selection never
  matched; use 1440-minute sentinel
- Pi kiosk cannot fetch CanvasKit fallback fonts from gstatic, rendering
  trend arrows as tofu; bundle a subset DejaVu font with the arrow glyphs
  and use it as fontFamilyFallback
